          "content": {
            "id": "c14675f7-7b2b-3c78-bef0-070e22afae4b",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Berkshire trims Apple stake, Quantum Computing reports Q3 profit",
            "description": "<p>Market Domination host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/josh-lipton/\">Josh Lipton</a> tracks several of the day's top trending stock tickers, including Apple (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AAPL\">AAPL</a>) after Berkshire Hathaway (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BRK-A\">BRK-A</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BRK-B\">BRK-B</a>) sold off more of its holdings in the iPhone developer, Home Depot's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/HD\">HD</a>) stock moves ahead of reporting earnings on Tuesday, and Quantum Computing (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/QUBT\">QUBT</a>) beating third quarter earnings and revenue estimates.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-domination/\">Market Domination</a>.</p>",
